<title>CHINA: China's 1996 coal imports soar by 99.2 pct.</title>
<headline>China's 1996 coal imports soar by 99.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports of coal soared in 1996 to 3.2 million tonnes compared with 1.61 million tonnes in 1995, customs figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Imports in December alone were 360,000 tonnes, the figures showed.</p>
<p>China's coal exports were 29.03 million million tonnes in 1996, up by 1.4 percent compared with 28.62 million tonnes a year ago, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Exports in December alone were 4.02 million tonnes, the figures showed.</p>
</text>
